        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "058_05.php 注册流程 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者通过 HTTP 请求的 query 参数 `username`（058_05.php:25 读取）提交输入，该值未经转义直接拼接进 INSERT 语句：058_05.php:48 `$sql = \"insert into users ( username, password) values(\\\"$username\\\", \\\"$pass\\\")\"`，随后在 058_05.php:49 交给 `mysql_query($sql)` 执行。代码中未见 mysql_real_escape_string、addslashes、预处理语句或类型白名单，双引号包裹的字符串字面量可被 `\"` 或反斜杠转义序列闭合，因此校验无效。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "058_05.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 47,
                  "endLine": 49
                }
              }
            }
          ],
